#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Sunan da kake son ba wa wannan UPS.  Ga Na'urorin APCUPSD da NUT, za a ƙirƙiri Na'urar Cacti mai dacewa ta atomatik don UPS ɗin ta amfani da wannan sunan.  Ga UPS masu tushen SNMP, dole ne ka fara ƙirƙirar Na'urar Cacti tukuna."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "Sabon UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Bayanin UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Ƙarin cikakken bayani game da wannan UPS idan ana buƙata."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Nau'in UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Nau'in UPS da kake sa ido a kai."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "ID na Poller"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Poller ɗin da wannan UPS yake ciki kuma yake sa ido a kansa"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Sunan Cibiya"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Cibiyar da wannan UPS take."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Babu"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Wuri"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Wurin zahiri da Na'urar take.  Wannan rubutun zai iya zama ɗaki, wurin raki, da sauransu."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Na'urar Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Ga UPS masu tushen SNMP, zaɓi Na'urar Cacti da za a yi amfani da ita don bayanan shiga na SNMP.  In ba haka ba, zaɓi Babu, kuma ƙarin manhajar UPS zai ƙirƙira maka Na'urar ta atomatik."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Ƙirƙira ta Atomatik a Binciken Farko"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "An Kunna"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Alama don fara tattara bayanai nan take."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Bayanin APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Sunan mai masauki na kwamfutar da ke gudanar da apcupsd ko sabar NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Tashar TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Shigar da Tashar TCP don wannan UPS.  Na asali na apcupsd shi ne 3551 kuma na asali na NUT shi ne 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Lokacin Jiran Amsa (daƙiƙoƙi)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Tsawon lokacin da poller yake jiran apcupsd ko sabar NUT kafin ya haƙura da wannan UPS, daga daƙiƙa 1 zuwa 120.  UPS masu tushen SNMP suna amfani da lokacin jiran amsa na SNMP a maimakon haka."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Sunan UPS na NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Sunan UPS akan sabar NUT, kamar yadda \"upsc -l\" ya jero (ɓangaren da ke gaban @ a cikin ups@host).  Sabar NUT guda ɗaya za ta iya hidimta wa UPS da yawa."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Sunan Mai Amfani na NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Na zaɓi ne.  Asusun upsd.users da za a tantance da shi.  Bar shi fanko don shiga na karatu kawai ba tare da suna ba, wanda shi ne yadda aka saba sa ido kan sabobin NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Kalmar Sirri ta NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Kalmar sirri ta Sunan Mai Amfani na NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Ɓoye haɗin da STARTTLS kafin a aika kowane bayanin shiga.  Ana tantance takardar shaidar sabar NUT da sunan mai masauki, don haka dole ne Cacti poller ya amince da takardar shaidar, ko kuma za ka iya nuna fayil ɗin CA / takardar shaidar sa a ƙasa."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin CA / Takardar Shaida"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Na zaɓi ne.  Cikakkiyar hanyar kan Cacti poller zuwa fayil ɗin PEM da ke riƙe da takardar shaidar CA (ko takardar shaidar saba da aka sanya wa hannu da kai) don tantance sabar NUT, misali /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  Sunan mai masauki da ke sama dole ne ya dace da takardar shaidar."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Ba da Izinin Takardar Shaida Mai Sa Hannun Kai"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Karɓi kowace takardar shaida ba tare da bincika ta ba.  Har yanzu haɗin yana ɓoye, amma ba a tantance sabar NUT ba, don haka mai shiga tsakani zai iya karanta bayanan shiga na NUT.  Fi son amfani da Fayil ɗin CA / Takardar Shaida da ke sama."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Sunan mai masauki inda wakilin snmp yake."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "Ba za a iya canza ID na Poller yayin da UPS yake da alaƙa da Na'urar Cacti ba.  Canza poller ɗin akan na'urar a maimakon haka."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Ba a sami Samfurin UPS ba! Ba za a iya yin kwafi ba."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Babu ko ɗaya daga cikin zaɓaɓɓun UPS da ke da Na'urar Cacti tukuna, don haka ba a gudanar da Sarrafa Zanen Jadawali ba.  Ana ƙirƙirar na'ura ne a binciken farko da ya yi nasara."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "An gudanar da Sarrafa Zanen Jadawali don UPS %d.  UPS %d ba su da Na'urar Cacti tukuna kuma an tsallake su."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es)."
msgstr "An gudanar da Sarrafa Zanen Jadawali don UPS %d."

