msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPSes.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from each device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgstr[0] "Danna 'Ci gaba' domin gudanar da Sarrafa Jadawali ta Atomatik ga UPS mai zuwa. Ana ƙirƙirar jadawalai, tushen bayanai da abubuwan bishiya daga samfuran na'urar da ƙa'idojin sarrafa kai da suka dace; jadawalan da suka riga suka wanzu za a bar su yadda suke. UPS ɗin da ke da Na'urar Cacti tuni kaɗai abin zai shafa."
msgstr[1] "Danna 'Ci gaba' domin gudanar da Sarrafa Jadawali ta Atomatik ga na'urorin UPS masu zuwa. Ana ƙirƙirar jadawalai, tushen bayanai da abubuwan bishiya daga samfuran kowace na'ura da ƙa'idojin sarrafa kai da suka dace; jadawalan da suka riga suka wanzu za a bar su yadda suke. UPS ɗin da ke da Na'urar Cacti tuni kaɗai abin zai shafa."

